        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 45 · AI Ad Performance Monitor\nDaily pulls ad campaign metrics, detects wasted spend and anomalies and recommends budget shifts.\n\n**Trigger:** schedule `0 8 * * *`\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate."
      }
